{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/pulls/9062","id":4489781707,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLj5faM8AAAABC5yhyw","html_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/pull/9062","diff_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/pull/9062.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/pull/9062.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/9062","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/pulls/9062/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/pulls/9062/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/9062/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/statuses/1b480eaef265205ae69ed440743afad68148daab","number":9062,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use the PJRT wheel built with NCCL 2.30.7 headers","user":{"login":"mcwitt","id":319411,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxOTQxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/319411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt","html_url":"https://github.com/mcwitt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Bump the ARM64 GPU PJRT wheel from XLA `3a8f3392723e` to [`b040736f2c4a`](https://github.com/marin-community/xla/releases/tag/marin-xla-pjrt-20260909-b040736f2c4a), adopting the NCCL 2.30.7 build-header default from [marin-community/xla#22](https://github.com/marin-community/xla/pull/22). This aligns compiled NCCL headers with the 2.30.7 runtime in Marin's GPU training lock. JAX stays at 0.11.1, and all other data in `uv.lock` is unchanged.\n\nThe hero launcher starts `hero-ragged_a2a-nccl2307-ep-step81k` from the pooled-wave lineage's step-81716 handoff, giving the promoted wheel its own run tree. It does not restore from the trial run's tree.\n\nThe release passed ragged all-to-all correctness checks on two GB200 GPUs with NCCL runtime 2.31.2, including confirmation that XLA's ragged all-to-all device kernel executed. Marin's four-GB200 ragged-EP gate also passed with the locked NCCL 2.30.7 runtime, checking forward outputs, gradients, and dropped assignments against a dense reference across four seeds.\n\nAt hero scale on 2026-09-09 (11 racks, 704 GPUs, restoring `step-81716`), the `3a8f3392723e` wheel hung four of four attempts on one rack's expert-parallel domain (rack indices 7, 9, 1, 2 after 43, 0, 0, 0 steps), with the #8870 signature: one rack at half CPU, every cross-rack AllReduce one member exactly three operations behind. A pre-merge build of this change (`b183c591142c`, the same source) then ran 225 clean steps including a 5.4 TB checkpoint, tracking the pooled-wave control step for step at −0.0064 nats with drops 1e-4 vs 3.4e-2 and MFU 23.3% vs 21.5%. Evidence is on marin-community/marin#8506; the mechanism is the 2.29.7 compat shim's per-rack LSA cliques without bounded barriers.\n\n`trigger_hero.sh` relaunches the hero as `hero-ragged_a2a-nccl2307-ep-step81k` from the same `step-81716` handoff, so the first 200 steps replay the validated window against the control and the lineage stays on main commits.\n\nPart of #8870.\n","labels":[{"id":10166074947,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLj5faM8AAAACXfH-Qw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/labels/agent-generated","name":"agent-generated","description":"Created by automation/agent","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":11981276996,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLj5faM8AAAACyiPHRA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/labels/agentic-lint","name":"agentic-lint","description":"Local agentic lint review completed","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-09T22:01:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T22:49:10Z","closed_at":"2026-09-09T22:49:09Z","merged_at":"2026-09-09T22:49:09Z","merge_commit_sha":"04fb3484560711bafcc98b2975d551363ee95067","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"dlwh","id":9633,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9633?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh","html_url":"https://github.com/dlwh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"marin-community:mwittmann/8870-pjrt-nccl2307","ref":"mwittmann/8870-pjrt-nccl2307","repo":{"id":775839592,"node_id":"R_kgDOLj5faA","name":"marin","full_name":"marin-community/marin","owner":{"login":"marin-community","id":210491432,"node_id":"O_kgDODIvYKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/210491432?v